Title: Night in the Woods
Author: Test Fixture

FADE IN:

EXT. FOREST - NIGHT

A gray WOLF pads between the trees. A small LAMB shivers in the brush, silent and still.

WOLF
The moon is high. The hunt begins.

An OWL watches from a high branch, unblinking.

OWL
Not tonight, brother. The ranger is near.

A RANGER steps into the clearing, lantern raised.

RANGER
Easy now. Nobody has to get hurt tonight.

FADE OUT.

THE END
